<",\"probes\":["<<probes.rows<<"],\"images\":["<<image_rows.str()<<"],\"scope\":\"Two shared-BLAS instances, per-instance stable IDs/materials/authored mirror sides, three metadata epochs including reordered slots and two actual in-place TLAS updates. Updates/retirement are synchronous on one owned queue; empirical bounded-ray allowance, no multiqueue/asynchronous update, device-loss recovery or general transform-error proof. Probe and rendered scenes each own one shared BLAS.\"}\n";f.close();require(bool(f),"Shared-instance receipt write failed");require(pass,"Shared-instance acceptance failed");std::cout<<"PASS shared instances:24probes,3renderedepochs,2TLASupdatesper-scene; worstnRMSE="<<worst<<'\n';return 0;
